/**
 * Coastal / intertidal foraging catalog — California + Pacific NW coast seed set.
 *
 * Researched against official and reputable sources (CDFW/CDPH, WDFW/WDOH,
 * ODFW/ODA, Sea Grant programs, NOAA/WHOI HAB, Monterey Bay Aquarium). Every
 * entry is `autoCompiled` → the detail page shows the "verify before foraging"
 * caveat. Unlike plants, the dominant hazard is invisible biotoxins and harvest
 * quarantines, so shellfish carry `biotoxinNotes` + `regulations`, and the four
 * `hazard` entries (PSP / domoic acid / DSP / Vibrio) are catalogued as warning
 * cards that shellfish link to. ALWAYS check the current state advisory.
 */
